# Datsun Bluebird 910 four-door saloon, 1980-1984.
#
# The last rear-wheel-drive Bluebird: simple, clean-cut squared-off lines and a
# reputation for reliability, sold in Britain from 1980 as the Datsun Bluebird
# 1.6 and 1.8.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nissan_Bluebird_(910)
#
# Dimensions 4.350 x 1.650 x 1.400 m, wheelbase 2.525 m, four-door saloon (the
# estate and coupe are 50 mm longer). Mirrors take the modelled width to
# 1.807 m.
#
# Colours. No UK colour card for the 910 was located, so the objects carry plain
# colour names rather than invented marketing names: white, silver, red and pale
# blue, the finishes common on the car in British photographs of the period.
# Weights silver 3, white 3, red 2, blue 2, total 10, provisional pending the
# central rebate rebase.
#
# Speed 160 km/h for the 1.8, the volume UK model. Comfort 65/428, on the line
# 330 + 1.5 x 65, between the Cortina-class cars and the Sierra. Classes 0,1,2.
#
# Dates are road presence: January 1980 intro, retires staggered 1996-1999 on a
# sixteen- to nineteen-year tail.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/nissan-bluebird-910.blend. Interchange:
# citycars/4.5/nissan-bluebird-910.dae (58 objects). References:
# citycars/references/nissan-bluebird-910/ (gitignored; Wikimedia Commons).
#
# Accepted deviations: the model's roof sits slightly taller than the profile
# photograph suggests (0.322 of length against a photographic 0.308), and the
# published 1.400 m height was kept. At 128 px the squared-off three-box
# silhouette, the rectangular headlamps and the horizontal tail lamps read
# correctly.

obj=citycar
name=DatsunBluebird910(Silver)
copyright=JamesPetts

DistributionWeight=3
intro_year=1980
intro_month=1
retire_year=1999
retire_month=6
speed=160
length=3
class=0,1,2
maximum_comfortable_journey_minutes=65
maximum_tolerable_journey_minutes=428

Image[E]=./images/nissan-bluebird-910-silver_E.0.0,-33,14
Image[SE]=./images/nissan-bluebird-910-silver_SE.0.0,-13,0
Image[S]=./images/nissan-bluebird-910-silver_S.0.0,0,0
Image[SW]=./images/nissan-bluebird-910-silver_SW.0.0,-8,10
Image[W]=./images/nissan-bluebird-910-silver_W.0.0,4,5
Image[NW]=./images/nissan-bluebird-910-silver_NW.0.0,12,10
Image[N]=./images/nissan-bluebird-910-silver_N.0.0,0,33
